      "writtenOn": "2024-12-20T21:11:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I took a crack at this, PTAL.\n\nI created a new `VersionedLinkableInterface` with stubs-related functions as well as a getter for the `VersionedInterface` provided by the module\u0027s library. This also reduces the number of `cc.Module` level functions considerably, as many of those simply called into the `libraryInterface` equivalent.\n\n`setAPIListCoverageXMLPath`, `setSymbolFilePath`, and `setVersionScriptPath` are no longer part of any `LinkableInterface`, as the `compileModuleLibApiStubs()` function will be reproduced for `rust.libraryDecorator`. I\u0027ve pulled the logic out for calculating the genstubFlags into a separate function `GetApiStubsFlags` that `rust` can call into.",
      "parentUuid": "4642a7aa_d0635dc4",
      "revId": "e93496ed92f962131c32c50c9770477ea78d0d9d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
